{
  "name": "realism-beds-storage",
  "description": "Wave 1B realism audit: beds (5) + storage (11) defs, each placed alone at the L/D centre and captured from a low 3/4 side angle (floor-contact + silhouette). Variant frames for distinct modes.",
  "url": "http://localhost:5302/",
